        "unverified_reason": "The exact local Ollama qwen3.5:9b digest, product-adapter preflight, and all eight strict isolated Hawk health checks passed. A fresh local run proved sensitive pre-provider block, benign real-provider allow, controlled fragmented api_key canary output, and benign allow after API restart with four distinct Hawk evidence IDs. Production provider fleet, clean install, upgrade, rollback, and customer acceptance remain unproven."
